Gestao -> Producer : 1.3: enfileirarComando(imei, "CORTE_COMBUSTIVEL")
Producer -> Gateway : 1.4: publicarKafka(topico_comandos)
Gateway -> HW : 1.5: [MQTT Publish para HW]

@enduml
